    <h1 class="legal-title">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-intro">Seascape Vacations uses cookies and browser storage to keep the site working, remember simple site preferences, and understand which booking paths visitors use. The current site uses GA4 and Seascape conversion tracking, not Meta Pixel or PostHog.</p>
  </div>
